OL,3,GNEWSADoctor 'mistakenly' facing #5,000
OL,4,Ain congestion fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor says he has been "mistakenly"
OL,7,Ffined almost #5,000 for breaches of
OL,8,FOxford's temporary congestion charge
OL,9,Fand traffic filters.
OL,11,FHasanen Al-Taiar is a consultant
OL,12,Fforensic psychiatrist working in
OL,13,FOxford, making him eligible for permits
OL,14,Fto travel through city charge points
OL,15,Fwithout facing any fines.
OL,17,FBut he said despite correctly
OL,18,Fregistering for those permits, he had
OL,19,Fbeen handed 49 Penalty Charge Notices
OL,20,F(PCNs) for breaching the rules since
OL,21,FDecember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
